{"id":"vod_sn_38259","vodId":"38259","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"肯普法","name_cn":"肯普法","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/34c0422810acccdbb6085dff96418f50.jpg"},"summary":"濑能名津流（井上麻里奈 配音）只是一个普通的高中生，但是，某一日，被选中的他居然变身成为了女体！并且，一只陪伴在他身边的内脏玩偶切腹虎（野村道子 配音）开口说起了话。切腹虎告诉濑能名津流，他被选中成为了“肯普法”，而作为一名肯普法，他的使命就是与同类“白色肯普法”进行战斗。　　濑能名津流的生活从此与普通二字再无关联，令他意外的是，他周围的几个可爱女生，居然都是肯普法战士。性格内向，但变身之后就会万分可爱的美嵨红音（堀江由衣 配音）；外表冷酷但实则非常腹黑的三乡雫（名冢佳织 配音）；天真直率，个性有些像男孩子的近堂水岛（阿澄佳奈 配音），在她们的陪伴下，濑能名津流开始了他的战斗。为何要战斗？白色肯普法究竟是谁？这一切的谜团等待着濑能名津流去揭开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yg8yJSMeSx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T8uVa0VAgF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rQmJKs2KVD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UMzBQ5EVVL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/57DKiP0UUq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vHG6rYX4LX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b68e5jqJ7f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k4nMuM5Td71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uff7ueTQHn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AD5PkKkcUT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R7vitk4Sem1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xFmEbHxGB01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/svj77MF9BP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H1MSMxR9d